# Performance Web Extrema - Otimizando Core Web Vitals

Compartilho as estratégias que uso para alcançar pontuações de 99-100 no Lighthouse e otimizar Core Web Vitals.

## Largest Contentful Paint (LCP) < 2.5s

### Estratégias de Otimização

**1. Resource Hints Estratégicos**
```html
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://api.example.com">
<link rel="preload" href="/hero-image.webp" as="image">
```

**2. Imagens Otimizadas com Next.js**
```typescript
import Image from 'next/image'

const HeroSection = () => (
  <Image
    src="/hero.webp"
    alt="Hero image"
    width={1200}
    height={600}
    priority
    placeholder="blur"
    blurDataURL="data:image/jpeg;base64,/9j/4AAQSkZJRgABAQAAAQ..."
  />
)
```

**3. Critical CSS Inline**
```typescript
// next.config.js
module.exports = {
  experimental: {
    optimizeCss: true,
    craCompat: true
  },
  compiler: {
    removeConsole: process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production'
  }
}
```

## Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) < 0.1

### Prevenção de Layout Shifts

**1. Dimensões Explícitas**
```css
.skeleton-loader {
  width: 100%;
  height: 200px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f0f0f0 25%, #e0e0e0 50%, #f0f0f0 75%);
  background-size: 200% 100%;
  animation: loading 1.5s infinite;
}

@keyframes loading {
  0% { background-position: 200% 0; }
  100% { background-position: -200% 0; }
}
```

**2. Font Loading Otimizado**
```css
@font-face {
  font-family: 'CustomFont';
  src: url('/fonts/custom.woff2') format('woff2');
  font-display: swap;
  font-weight: 100 900;
}
```

**3. Layout Reservado para Ads**
```typescript
const AdSlot = ({ width, height }: { width: number; height: number }) => {
  const [loaded, setLoaded] = useState(false)

  return (
    <div 
      style={{ width, height, minHeight: height }}
      className="ad-container"
    >
      {!loaded && (
        <div className="ad-placeholder">
          <span>Anúncio</span>
        </div>
      )}
      <Script
        src="https://ads.google.com/ad.js"
        onLoad={() => setLoaded(true)}
        strategy="afterInteractive"
      />
    </div>
  )
}
```

## First Input Delay (FID) < 100ms

### Code Splitting Inteligente

```typescript
// Lazy loading de rotas
const Dashboard = lazy(() => import('../pages/Dashboard'))
const Profile = lazy(() => import('../pages/Profile'))
const Settings = lazy(() => 
  import('../pages/Settings').then(module => ({
    default: module.Settings
  }))
)

// Preloading condicional
const usePreloadRoute = (routeName: string, condition: boolean) => {
  useEffect(() => {
    if (condition) {
      const componentImport = {
        dashboard: () => import('../pages/Dashboard'),
        profile: () => import('../pages/Profile')
      }[routeName]

      componentImport?.()
    }
  }, [routeName, condition])
}
```

### Web Workers para Processamento Pesado

```typescript
// worker.ts
self.onmessage = function(e) {
  const { data, type } = e.data

  switch(type) {
    case 'PROCESS_DATA':
      const result = heavyCalculation(data)
      self.postMessage({ type: 'DATA_PROCESSED', result })
      break
  }
}

// useWorker hook
const useWorker = (workerScript: string) => {
  const workerRef = useRef<Worker>()

  useEffect(() => {
    workerRef.current = new Worker(workerScript)
    return () => workerRef.current?.terminate()
  }, [])

  const postMessage = useCallback((message: any) => {
    workerRef.current?.postMessage(message)
  }, [])

  return { postMessage, worker: workerRef.current }
}
```

## Bundle Optimization

### Webpack Bundle Analyzer
```typescript
// next.config.js
const withBundleAnalyzer = require('@next/bundle-analyzer')({
  enabled: process.env.ANALYZE === 'true'
})

module.exports = withBundleAnalyzer({
  webpack: (config) => {
    if (config.mode === 'production') {
      config.optimization.splitChunks = {
        chunks: 'all',
        cacheGroups: {
          vendor: {
            test: /[\\/]node_modules[\\/]/,
            name: 'vendors',
            priority: 10,
            enforce: true
          },
          common: {
            minChunks: 2,
            priority: 5,
            reuseExistingChunk: true
          }
        }
      }
    }
    return config
  }
})
```

## Monitoramento Contínuo

```typescript
// performance-monitor.ts
const measureWebVitals = (metric: any) => {
  switch (metric.name) {
    case 'CLS':
      analytics.track('Web Vital', {
        metric: 'CLS',
        value: metric.value,
        rating: metric.rating
      })
      break
    case 'FID':
      analytics.track('Web Vital', {
        metric: 'FID', 
        value: metric.value,
        rating: metric.rating
      })
      break
    case 'LCP':
      analytics.track('Web Vital', {
        metric: 'LCP',
        value: metric.value,
        rating: metric.rating
      })
      break
  }
}

// _app.tsx
export function reportWebVitals(metric: NextWebVitalsMetric) {
  measureWebVitals(metric)
}
```

## Resultados Alcançados

Com essas otimizações, consistentemente alcanço:
- **Performance**: 99-100
- **LCP**: < 1.2s
- **FID**: < 50ms  
- **CLS**: < 0.05

A performance não é um destino, é uma jornada contínua de medição e otimização.

